  "title": "Ultra-High-Strength Steel Gondola™ Increases Capacity and Durability",
  "summary": "Greenbrier’s Ultra-High-Strength Steel Gondola™ uses advanced high-strength steel to increase load capacity by up to 15% while reducing railcar weight. The redesigned gondola improves durability and efficiency for moving dense commodities such as aggregates, metals and industrial materials. The next-generation design helps railroads and shippers move more product with fewer railcars.",
